      <description>&lt;img src="https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/esd/eo/images/iotd/2026/taking-a-gander-at-utah’s-goosenecks/ISS075-E-188830_th.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1280.1280.jpeg" alt="Taking a Gander at Utah’s Goosenecks"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The San Juan River has carved deep, improbably curvy meanders into the desert landscape.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:thumbnail url="https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/esd/eo/images/iotd/2026/taking-a-gander-at-utah’s-goosenecks/ISS075-E-188830_th.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1280.1280.jpeg" />
