      <description>&lt;img src="https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/esd/eo/images/iotd/2026/island-of-snakes,-cats,-and-ophiolites/akrotirisaltlake_oli_20261010_th.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1280.1280.jpeg" alt="Cyprus: Island of Snakes, Cats, and Ophiolites"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The third-largest island in the Mediterranean Sea exposes an ancient piece of the ocean floor and hosts a clowder of cats.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:thumbnail url="https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/esd/eo/images/iotd/2026/island-of-snakes,-cats,-and-ophiolites/akrotirisaltlake_oli_20261010_th.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1280.1280.jpeg" />
